丸い目をした美少女のお嬢様だったけど歳をとってセクシーな感じになってきたかんじ\n・ロングヘア\n・血みたいな暗めのリップ\n\nでｵﾅｼｬｽ‼︎‼︎", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mamegashi002/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d700630/uploads/origins/bc53b2b2-4b8f-4747-8ecf-8f343baaaaaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61382b6c768ccf72e5eaee20d5d3ebaf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d700630/uploads/origins/bc53b2b2-4b8f-4747-8ecf-8f343baaaaaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61382b6c768ccf72e5eaee20d5d3ebaf, https://si.imgix.net/8d700630/uploads/origins/bc53b2b2-4b8f-4747-8ecf-8f343baaaaaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdb3a34592fe8c2ed048b0ff1d885d94 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d700630/uploads/origins/bc53b2b2-4b8f-4747-8ecf-8f343baaaaaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=655975937d3a5d91250738a76593e405 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "瞳がグリーンの錆び猫を描いていただけないでしょうか…！ \nお時間等に余裕があればで全然構いませんのでもし可能でしたらよろしくお願い致します！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1H56_NCB2hScywNB1slkbMIB4hjvhOu0L/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1slFvtK0tgH5fcI7_8LMTndyeAed-5CDc/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mamegashi002/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a324ac4/uploads/origins/2f72c9ff-3c16-4647-912a-99a4c473cd81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d20ea6def8d34256b8eb2bb03f55de84", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a324ac4/uploads/origins/2f72c9ff-3c16-4647-912a-99a4c473cd81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d20ea6def8d34256b8eb2bb03f55de84, https://si.imgix.net/9a324ac4/uploads/origins/2f72c9ff-3c16-4647-912a-99a4c473cd81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=231eebedad1dcc7e8b8831c78d5d03c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a324ac4/uploads/origins/